{"id": "ho_staircase_orders_mod", "signature": "solve(step_sizes, height)", "statement": "`step_sizes` is a list of positive integers; repeated values are ignored, so only the distinct sizes matter. Count the ordered sequences of steps (each step is one of the distinct sizes, and each size may be used any number of times, with different orders counted as different sequences) whose sizes sum exactly to `height`. `height` is a non-negative integer; the empty sequence counts when height is 0, so the answer is 1 then, and 0 when no sequence exists. Return the count modulo 1000000007.", "tests": [{"args": [[1, 2], 3], "expected": 3}, {"args": [[1, 2], 0], "expected": 1}, {"args": [[3], 5], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[1, 1, 2], 3], "expected": 3}, {"args": [[1], 100], "expected": 1}, {"args": [[1, 2, 3], 30], "expected": 53798080}, {"args": [[2, 5], 1000000], "expected": 56507120}, {"args": [[], 0], "expected": 1}, {"args": [[], 4], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[2, 3], 10], "expected": 7}, {"args": [[5, 7], 20], "expected": 1}, {"args": [[1, 2, 3, 4], 10], "expected": 401}], "facts": [["arg", "step_sizes", "int_list"], ["arg", "height", "int"], ["items", "step_sizes"], ["unique", "step_sizes"], ["target", "height"], ["ask", "count_ways"], ["use", "unlimited"], ["order", "matters"], ["modulo", "1000000007"], ["size", "step_sizes", "tiny"], ["size", "height", "large"], ["guarantees", "step_sizes", "positive"], ["guarantees", "step_sizes", "distinct"]], "deps": {"schema": ["knapsack"], "uses": ["knap_count_ways"], "solution_sha256": "08ea8372879655a25cd1da407f6678598b25dde2e9a2c19007175615908fc6d3", "reference_sha256": "3dfb7f3779cf70b4a01f44926430fc2c0bd1bf86296c30383d919b54583a1260"}}